   "source": [
    "# Exercise 1: Discover the Building Blocks of Reinforcement Learning\n",
    "\n",
    "This exercise introduces the first interaction with a reinforcement learning environment (`CartPole-v1`). The goal is to explore the fundamental cycle: **observation -> action -> reward**.\n",
    "\n",
    "It explores the `observation_space` (what the agent sees) and the `action_space` (what the agent can do), followed by the creation of a simple random agent to run both headlessly and with visualization."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "abe627e4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "%matplotlib inline\n",
    "# Imports"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "be1de169",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import logging\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "import os\n",
    "\n",
    "# Configure logging for the notebook\n",
    "logging.basicConfig(level=logging.INFO, format='%(message)s', force=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Add the parent directory to the path so we can import our modules\n",
    "sys.path.append(os.path.abspath('..'))\n",
    "\n",
    from src.exercise_1.explorer import explore_environment_spaces
    from src.exercise_1.agent import run_random_agent
    from src.exercise_1.visualization import display_random_agent_interaction
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8ca59b4f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Exploring the Environment\n",
    "\n",
    "First, we create a `CartPole-v1` instance and inspect its spaces. Notice that the observation space is continuous (`Box`) while the action space is discrete (`Discrete`)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "fd402265",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stderr",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "--- Exploring Environment: CartPole-v1 ---\n",
      "\n",
      "[Observation Space]\n",
      "Type: <class 'gymnasium.spaces.box.Box'>\n",
      "Shape: (4,)\n",
      "Sample Observation: [ 4.165778    2.300315   -0.32902488 -1.3430452 ]\n",
      "\n",
      "[Action Space]\n",
      "Type: <class 'gymnasium.spaces.discrete.Discrete'>\n",
      "Number of actions (discrete): 2\n",
      "Sample Action: 0\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "env_id = 'CartPole-v1'\n",
    "env = explore_environment_spaces(env_id)"
   ]
  },
