   "source": [
    "## 2. Running the Agent (Headless Loop)\n",
    "\n",
    "Now, let's run a random agent for 10 episodes and print out the total rewards for each episode. This logic uses the `.step()` function to transition the environment based on random actions."
   ]
  },
